WEBVTT

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:44.540
Episode 3

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:44.540
The Dark Star that Shines for You Alone

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:44.540
Part 3

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:48.540
TWENTIES

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:05.100
He's unconscious,

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:09.440
but he absolutely refuses
to let go of you.

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:12.740
Quite the chivalrous one, I guess?

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:14.860
He's a boy, isn't he?

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:16.690
MAYUMI DOJIMA

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:21.250
Here you go, young lady.

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:24.120
The glasses that I forgot this
morning...

00:02:28.130 --> 00:02:29.380
I'm Rei.

00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:33.130
I won't be spending too much time
with you, but nice to meet you.

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:33.210
REI

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:40.560
Please let me speak with the person
with the most authority among you.

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:44.100
I have the most authority
among the Twenties.

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:46.730
Though, I'm also
the most competent as well.

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:55.360
I will stay calm. I won't fight back.
I don't care what happens to me.

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:57.240
So please...

00:02:57.240 --> 00:03:00.370
please let him go home.

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:02.240
He has nothing to do with this.

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:04.830
Please.

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:08.380
Is that so?

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:14.510
Do you think I'd listen to such a plea?

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:18.890
I'm a kidnapper, a criminal,
an evil person.

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:20.640
I think you will.

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:21.930
You think so?

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:30.650
I don't think she's a kind person.

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:35.110
But I don't think she's
a completely evil person, either.

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:37.700
All right. Do as you like.

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:41.120
Twelve, stop the car.

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:42.870
There's absolutely no need to stop.

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:48.250
Because such a way of life
is not beautiful.

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:49.830
MANABU SOTOIN

00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:53.210
After coming this far, I was sure of it.

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:55.840
Manabu Sotoin.

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:59.340
He's a bona fide idiot.

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:01.550
Are you the kidnapper?

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:06.060
I'm Manabu Sotoin, the president
of the Pretty Boy Detective Club.

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:08.940
I see. You're the president.

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:13.020
So let's hear exactly who you are
and what you're after.

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:16.400
Who we are is a mystery,
and what we're after is money.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:19.320
If you want to know about our client,
you should give up.

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:21.200
I don't know, either.

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:25.910
By not knowing, we "Twenties"
are protecting our clients.

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:29.420
How strange that you protect
your clients by not knowing.

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:32.540
If it were me,
I'd like to protect them by knowing.

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:36.090
Protect? I don't think you
can protect anything if you're dead.

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:37.630
I can protect my sense
of aestheticism.

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:43.430
If I can't protect that, it's like not
being able to protect anything at all.

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:47.020
And if you know of aestheticism,
it's the same as knowing everything.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:53.110
Then, that means you must know
the reason why she's being targeted?

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:54.230
Of course.

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:57.480
It's because she saw something
that she shouldn't have, right?

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:59.860
Though, questions remain.

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:04.070
Restraining her like this
won't completely conceal it.

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:09.910
Or are you saying you're going to kidnap
everyone who witnessed that light?

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:07.530
MANABU
SOTOIN

00:05:11.460 --> 00:05:14.920
I see. Then you really don't know.

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:17.300
She's the only witness.

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:22.930
This light in question was something
that only Mayumi Dojima's eyes

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:25.390
could see in this world.

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:27.430
MAYUMI DOJIMA

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:30.480
There's a problem with my eyes.

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:32.810
It's not that I have bad eyesight.

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:34.520
My eyesight is too good.

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:37.820
I can see things very, very, very clearly.

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:42.070
I can promptly notice adults
hidden around a corner,

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:46.030
or a group of students from
other schools walking home that

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:48.990
I haven't bumped into yet.

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:52.920
And enough to become an unnecessary
witness to a military satellite

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:55.500
being shot down.

00:05:56.380 --> 00:06:00.800
From my client's point of view,
it's less troublesome.

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:05.340
They can keep their margin of safety
by continuing surveillance on just Mayumi.

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:07.930
So you've been secretly observing

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:10.930
a dream-chasing innocent girl who
made an astronomical observation

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:12.890
searching for a star

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:16.940
that cannot possibly exist
for the past ten years.

00:06:16.940 --> 00:06:20.070
I wasn't in charge of doing that, though.

00:06:20.070 --> 00:06:23.110
But it's true that Mayumi
was under surveillance.

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:28.490
And apparently there was some talk about
freeing her soon from that surveillance.

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:30.490
But I didn't think
in the course of one day,

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:34.040
she would get this close to the truth.

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:36.170
That's the Pretty Boy
Detective Club for you.

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:40.420
And what exactly is
the Pretty Boy Detective Club?

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:42.800
One, "Be pretty."

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:45.680
Two, "Be a boy."

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:48.640
Three, "Be a detective."

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:50.930
And that's the Pretty Boy
Detective Club?

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:53.310
Oh my, that's really literal.

00:06:53.310 --> 00:06:57.520
Oh no. That alone
is a simple Pretty Boy Detective.

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:00.320
No matter how many
pretty boy detectives gather,

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:03.990
that is merely a gathering
of pretty boy detectives.

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:08.820
The most important rule of the Pretty Boy
Detective Club is the fourth rule.

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:11.080
Fourth rule?

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:14.660
Be pretty, be a boy,
be a detective, and...

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:17.330
The fourth rule of
the Pretty Boy Detective Club,

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:18.580
CLUB

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:20.590
"Be a team."

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:28.800
Boss! There's a bicycle that's
been following us for a while.

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:32.180
CHASE

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:37.100
Is that the boy who I heard was riding
double in a strange way this morning?

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:39.900
Correct. That is Hyota the Adonis.

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:40.980
I see.

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:46.150
So, Mayumi.

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:47.820
How do you see this?

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:50.120
Huh? H-How do I...

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:53.200
It doesn't look like
he's recklessly chasing after us.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:58.870
He's chasing after us
with a clear purpose.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:56.030
HYOTA ASHIKAGA

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:00.420
That's how I feel.

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:03.630
Twelve, stop the car.

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:06.040
MOBILE PHONE

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:16.310
Leader, I'm glad to see you're okay.

00:08:16.310 --> 00:08:19.100
Yes, as you can see.

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:22.480
Can I ask you for an explanation,
little short-pants?

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:26.240
I'm Adonis, ma'am.

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:27.360
"Beautiful legs"?

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:30.030
I can see that part is true.

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:31.370
No, wait...

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:34.870
Courier. I wanted to say courier.

00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:35.950
Courier?

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:43.340
Twelve, whose current
whereabouts are unknown?

00:08:43.340 --> 00:08:48.220
Looks like we haven't had periodic reports
from Thirteen, Eighteen, and Nineteen.

00:08:48.220 --> 00:08:52.180
It means our mission is
a success, Dojima.

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:55.600
So let's swap hostages, ma'am.

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:57.180
HOSTAGE SWAP

00:08:59.480 --> 00:09:01.100
Hello?

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:02.980
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:08.990
I am the vice-president of the Pretty Boy
Detective Club, Nagahiro Sakiguchi.

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:11.360
I would like to propose an exchange.

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:15.780
Our leader, mobile unit, and client.

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:19.200
I would like to propose
an exchange between them and

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:21.920
the three currently in our custody.

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:23.830
Time and location?

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:25.670
The time would be right away.

00:09:25.670 --> 00:09:29.760
For the location, how about
the middle school we attend?

00:09:29.760 --> 00:09:32.510
Of course, this is a deal
between you and us,

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:36.310
the Twenties and the
Pretty Boy Detective Club.

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:38.890
Okay. But...

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:43.230
If you do anything to harm my boys...

00:09:43.230 --> 00:09:45.440
I'll kill all three of them.

00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:50.400
That's our line.

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:55.530
If Dojima, our leader, or Hyota
have even one scratch on them...

00:09:55.530 --> 00:10:00.160
I'll use any means possible
to find you and kill you!

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:00.240
NAGAHIRO SAKIGUCHI

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:00.240
MICHIRU FUKUROI

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:00.240
SOSAKU YUBIWA

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:08.210
You don't have to do that.
You should be preparing our meal.

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:09.710
I'm hungry.

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:11.970
And I feel like eating Chinese food.

00:10:11.970 --> 00:10:14.010
Feel like eating Chinese food?

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:17.930
Leader, you sound like your normal self.

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:19.390
Of course.

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:21.640
Was there ever a time
when I wasn't myself?

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:30.400
Well, it really does seem like
you have a good team, Sotoin.

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:32.440
It's the best team.

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:34.320
You know, Sotoin...

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:37.660
What do you think your boys are up to?

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:41.200
Who knows? Don't ask me.

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:44.460
But there is one thing for certain.

00:10:46.460 --> 00:10:50.420
I will be eating Chinese food tonight.

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:52.540
APOLOGY

00:10:56.640 --> 00:11:00.350
I'm sorry I didn't tell you
about my eyes.

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:02.470
About your eyes? Oh...

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:05.060
You don't have to worry about that.

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:10.730
I see, so that's why you got mad when
I complimented the beauty of your eyes.

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:17.530
However, isn't that trait beneficial for
you and your dream to become an astronaut?

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:22.660
The fact that I have good vision
means that I overwork my eyes.

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:23.870
I see.

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:26.620
It's true that I have good eyes.

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:29.170
So much that I can see people
hiding behind a wall,

00:11:29.170 --> 00:11:32.840
and even military satellites
being shot down.

00:11:33.800 --> 00:11:36.470
But, they're a little too good.

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:42.850
If I keep overworking them,
apparently I'll go blind in my twenties.

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:49.810
That's why I'm normally
"protecting" them with my glasses.

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:54.070
So, it's a dream that I had to give up on.

00:11:54.070 --> 00:11:58.860
I wasn't allowed to dream of
an occupation like an astronaut.

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:04.120
And that's why your parents
are against your dream.

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:08.080
Your parents are correct about that.

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:17.720
To be a boy means to dream, but that's
not necessarily giving up on your dream.

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:20.840
It means having as many dreams
as you want.

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:23.810
Rest assured, Mayumi Dojima.

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:28.730
Finding a dream
is surely easier than finding a star.

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:35.850
GUIDANCE

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:40.610
Sorry about this, Boss.

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:44.330
Oh, it's fine.

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:53.000
Get out.

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:03.010
And now...

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:07.560
I will have you assist us
from here, Mayumi.

00:13:09.060 --> 00:13:11.270
M-My neck...

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:14.480
I will utilize your eyes.

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:17.780
Those eyes that supposedly
can see beyond walls.

00:13:18.820 --> 00:13:21.450
If there are any traps,
please find them.

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:25.280
Oh, you don't have to tell me
through your words.

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:28.450
I can understand most things
just by looking at your facial expression.

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:33.290
When I was talking about
how I kept quiet about my eyes,

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:34.710
she was listening from
the passenger seat.

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:38.170
The client will tell lies.

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:40.220
That's a basic rule of being a detective.

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:43.760
Yes. I see.

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:50.100
Don't worry. As long as you
don't resist, I won't be rough.

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:54.770
Not to you, or to the kids
of the Pretty Boy Detective Club.

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:57.320
I'm actually looking forward
to meeting them.

00:13:57.320 --> 00:13:59.190
Pretty boys, huh?

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:01.240
I might make some money
if I sell them off.

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:26.140
Three silhouettes of children,
and three silhouettes of adults.

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:32.060
Sotoin, you open it.

00:14:32.060 --> 00:14:34.020
Of course, leave it to me.

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:42.150
CAUSE OF DEFEAT

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:54.290
A stealth helicopter?

00:14:56.670 --> 00:15:01.920
This spotlight is a bit too bright
if it's meant for my welcoming.

00:15:12.310 --> 00:15:17.440
So I was talking to you the whole time,
from the very beginning?

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:20.190
Yes, that's correct, Boss.

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:26.490
Someone who happens to have
a similar voice? No, that's not it.

00:15:26.490 --> 00:15:27.990
Were you mimicking his voice?

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:31.080
Yes, that's correct, Boss.

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:33.160
Nagahiro the Orator.

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:35.580
A pretty boy with a rainbow voice.

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:41.500
Why wasn't Mayumi
able to see through the trap?

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:45.260
With your eyesight, you should've noticed
the existence of the helicopter.

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:46.340
Come now!

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:48.760
Surely you cannot be serious.

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:53.770
This result, for you, and for this story,

00:15:53.770 --> 00:15:57.730
was nothing less than
a foregone conclusion!

00:15:57.730 --> 00:16:01.230
The ones who took away the motivation
for Mayumi Dojima to look up at the sky

00:16:02.650 --> 00:16:05.280
are none other than yourselves!

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:07.110
DRAMA OF ARREST

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:10.320
Well done, everyone.

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:11.660
This case will be recorded

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:18.000
as another bright, beautiful adventure
for the Pretty Boy Detective Club.

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:21.170
The real adventure is still forthcoming.

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:25.760
I'm sure we'll get chewed out
once we're at the police station.

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:26.920
Oh, brother.

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:28.800
But before that...

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:33.600
Do you have anything to eat? I'm starving.

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:37.180
It's prepared. A full set
of your favorite Chinese food.

00:16:38.440 --> 00:16:41.810
Dojima, if you can promise me
you'll properly eat the food,

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:43.570
you can eat with us.

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:52.950
Thanks, I'll have some.

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:55.410
EPILOGUE

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:57.910
NEXT DAY

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:57.910
AFTER SCHOOL

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:05.880
Rei?

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:11.930
Don't be so alarmed. Breaking out
of prison is like a hobby for me.

00:17:11.930 --> 00:17:16.140
I have a delivery.
This time, you're the recipient.

00:17:16.140 --> 00:17:18.640
One message.

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:21.940
From the people who asked me
to kidnap you yesterday.

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:26.690
They're asking you to make a deal instead.

00:17:28.490 --> 00:17:33.120
If you stay quiet about
what you saw ten years ago,

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:36.580
they said they can help you
regarding your future.

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:41.290
Congratulations.

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:44.420
Your solitary astrological
observations spanning ten years

00:17:44.420 --> 00:17:45.960
will not be meaningless anymore.

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:47.210
I decline.

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:49.170
Wait, what?

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:50.720
You're going to decline?

00:17:50.720 --> 00:17:54.220
Well, if that's the case,
I'll tell them that.

00:17:54.220 --> 00:17:58.140
But this is your future on the line.

00:17:58.140 --> 00:18:01.440
My future is on the line? So what?

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:07.570
Even when his life was on the line,
I know someone who immediately answered,

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:11.900
"That way of living is not beautiful."

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:16.580
Well, all right.

00:18:16.580 --> 00:18:20.620
They don't need to worry. I have
no intent on telling anyone about it.

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:22.080
The Pretty Boy Detective Club

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:23.750
is an organization
where the confidentiality

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:25.540
is requested from the client.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:26.880
Is that so?

00:18:28.050 --> 00:18:30.090
Well, I'll go tell them that.

