00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:38.350
How do you do?

00:18:40.020 --> 00:18:42.600
What the hell's up with that?

00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:45.480
What kind of change in policy is this?

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:48.020
Are you one of those people who bash
on the incumbent until they resign,

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:52.400
then once they resign you denounce them
as "irresponsible for resigning"?

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:52.480
MICHIRU FUKUROI

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:52.480
MICHIRU THE EPICURE

00:18:52.570 --> 00:18:56.910
Personally, I prefer girls
to wear skirts.

00:18:56.910 --> 00:19:01.160
Well, if everyone wears black stockings,
there's no real difference, right?

00:18:56.990 --> 00:19:01.240
HYOTA ASHIKAGA

00:18:56.990 --> 00:19:01.240
HYOTA THE ADONIS

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:03.910
Oh, I think this is a good thing.

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:08.920
That wig looks very natural too,
and you look rather shapely with it.

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:09.000
SOSAKU
YUBIWA

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:09.000
SOSAKU
THE
ARTISTE

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:09.000
NAGAHIRO
SAKIGUCHI

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:09.000
NAGAHIRO
THE
ORATOR

00:19:08.920 --> 00:19:12.510
So, Dojima, why are
you continuing that disguise?

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:19.260
Um, where's Sotoin?

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:20.310
Huh?

00:19:20.310 --> 00:19:21.680
Well, as I said before,

00:19:21.680 --> 00:19:26.520
he's still a "Kogoro" so he can't
come here right after class.

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:28.480
Hey, Sakiguchi.

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:34.650
I would like to ask a stupid question,
but what grade and class is Sotoin?

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:36.740
He's in 5-A.

00:19:36.740 --> 00:19:38.740
Oh, I see.

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:46.700
FIFTH GRADE STUDENT

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:42.830
That's why it's "Kogoro"?
As in "Little Five Boy"?

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:46.580
Yes. Yubiwa Academy has
an elementary division as well, correct?

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:51.000
Sorry to make you wait!

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:55.510
What's this? If that isn't none other
than Mayumi Dojima there.

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:59.010
Even today,
you still have the most beautiful eyes!

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:59.090
MANABU
SOTOIN

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:59.090
MANABU
THE
AESTHETE
FIFTH
GRADER

00:20:00.350 --> 00:20:05.100
I already knew what my first words
would be once I saw Sotoin.

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:06.730
Hey, Sotoin.

00:20:06.730 --> 00:20:10.190
You said you're always looking
for club members, right?

00:20:10.190 --> 00:20:13.940
Then will you let me join
the Pretty Boy Detective Club?

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:18.610
Why would you want to?

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:25.120
I felt that you would be able to teach me
how to use my eyes, Sotoin.

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:29.670
That you would find ways
to use my eyes in the correct way.

00:20:30.630 --> 00:20:33.500
No, not the correct way,

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:35.590
but in a beautiful way.

00:20:39.180 --> 00:20:43.890
It looks like you're yet another person
who has become captivated by beauty.

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:50.350
I'll allow it! Aestheticism is something
to learn, and also something to teach.

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:54.020
H-Hey, are you insane, Leader?
She's a girl.

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:57.400
As long as she has a boy's heart,
there should be no problems.

00:20:58.650 --> 00:21:04.330
Michiru, please immediately prepare food
for a new member welcoming party!

00:21:05.540 --> 00:21:09.370
Nagahiro, I'm trusting you
with the welcome speech.

00:21:09.370 --> 00:21:14.130
Hyota, I'm really looking forward
to seeing your tapdancing.

00:21:14.130 --> 00:21:15.800
That's right! Sosaku,

00:21:15.800 --> 00:21:20.180
how about we take this opportunity
to create a club member badge?

00:21:20.180 --> 00:21:23.430
We welcome you, Mayumi Dojima.

00:21:23.430 --> 00:21:28.180
You got past your tumultuous birthday,
and yet, you haven't become an adult.

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:30.810
Until the time you can
see your next dream,

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:33.770
until the day you wish to look up
at the sky once again,

00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:37.360
you can rest your wings
as you see fit right here.

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:42.280
A new star that shines brightly upon you
will surely be found someday.

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:47.580
You shall search to your heart's content.
Searching is indeed our duty.

00:21:47.580 --> 00:21:50.210
Welcome to the Pretty Boy
Detective Club!

00:21:51.960 --> 00:21:56.630
Beautifully, like a boy,
let us be detectives.

00:21:56.630 --> 00:22:00.220
And let us become the best team possible.

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:05.050
The first day after turning 14...

00:22:05.050 --> 00:22:08.470
Just like this, with a bit of pride,

00:22:09.430 --> 00:22:11.730
and with a bit of beauty,

00:22:13.310 --> 00:22:17.230
I had given up on my dream.

00:22:18.230 --> 00:22:21.020
THE BEGINNING
